{"sha": "e683a35675384d596d5290b1713d7ad7f26462e29fc8b9863c4469f45e3a3940", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g10:orders-of-magnitude} 章 --- 数量级：测量宇宙}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:orders-of-magnitude:1}", "\\emph{1.} $\\qty{750}{nm} = 750 \\times \\qty{e-9}{m} = \\qty{7.50e-7}{m}$.", "\\emph{2.} $\\qty{2.5}{km} = \\qty{2.5e3}{m}$.", "\\emph{3.} $\\qty{3.2}{\\micro m} = \\qty{3.2e-6}{m}$.", "\\emph{4.} $\\qty{0.15}{Tm} = 0.15 \\times \\qty{e12}{m} = \\qty{1.5e11}{m}$", "--- 一个天文单位。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:orders-of-magnitude:2}", "\\emph{1.} $\\qty{149600000}{km} = \\qty{1.496e11}{m}$：$4$ 位", "有效数字。", "\\emph{2.} $\\qty{1.06e-10}{m}$：$3$ 位有效数字（前导零", "永不计入）。", "\\emph{3.} $\\num{8.1e9}$：$2$ 位有效数字。", "\\emph{4.} $\\qty{5.20e-3}{s}$：$3$ 位有效数字（末尾的", "零是一种“承诺”）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:orders-of-magnitude:3}", "尾数和指数分别计算", "（依据\\cref{prop:g10:orders-of-magnitude:powers}）：", "\\[", "3 \\times 2 \\times 10^{8-5} = \\num{6e3}, \\qquad", "\\tfrac{8}{4} \\times 10^{4-(-3)} = \\num{2e7},", "\\]", "\\[", "5^{2} \\times 10^{12} = \\num{2.5e13}, \\qquad", "\\tfrac{4 \\times 3}{6} \\times 10^{-3-9+7} = \\num{2e-5} .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:orders-of-magnitude:4}", "人类：$1.7 < 5$，数量级 $\\qty{e0}{m}$。珠穆朗玛峰：", "$\\qty{8848}{m} = \\qty{8.848e3}{m}$，且 $8.848 \\geq 5$，数量级", "为 $\\qty{e4}{m}$。细菌：数量级 $\\qty{e-6}{m}$。地球：", "$5.97 \\geq 5$，数量级 $\\qty{e25}{kg}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:orders-of-magnitude:5}", "\\emph{1.} 半个刻度：$L = (127.0 \\pm 0.5)\\,\\unit{mm}$。", "\\emph{2.} $\\Delta L / L = 0.5/127 \\approx 0.4\\%$.", "\\emph{3.} 橡皮：$0.5/12 \\approx 4\\%$。铅笔的测量", "精度约高十倍 --- 同一把尺，绝对", "不确定度相同，被测物体长十倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:orders-of-magnitude:6}", "\\emph{1.} 比邻星：", "$4.24 \\times \\qty{9.47e15}{m} = \\qty{4.01e16}{m}$。天狼星：", "$8.6 \\times \\qty{9.47e15}{m} = \\qty{8.1e16}{m}$（两位有效", "数字，与输入数据相同）。", "\\emph{2.} $t = d/c = \\qty{2.4e13}{m} / \\qty{3.00e8}{m/s}", "= \\qty{8.0e4}{s}$，即 $\\num{8.0e4}/3600 \\approx \\qty{22}{h}$：", "几乎要等一整天才能收到探测器发来的每条消息。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:orders-of-magnitude:7}", "$t = d/c$，每次都如此。月球：", "$\\qty{3.84e8}{m}/\\qty{3.00e8}{m/s} = \\qty{1.28}{s}$。太阳：", "$\\qty{1.496e11}{m}/\\qty{3.00e8}{m/s} = \\qty{499}{s} \\approx", "\\qty{8.3}{min}$。海王星：", "$\\qty{4.50e12}{m}/\\qty{3.00e8}{m/s} = \\qty{1.50e4}{s} \\approx", "\\qty{4.2}{h}$。你看到海王星时，看到的是它大约", "四小时前的样子 --- 每台望远镜都是一台温和的“时光机”。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:orders-of-magnitude:8}", "\\emph{1.} 一张纸：$\\qty{52.0}{mm}/500 = \\qty{0.104}{mm}", "= \\qty{1.04e-4}{m}$。不确定度也相应除以 500：", "$\\qty{0.5}{mm}/500 = \\qty{0.001}{mm}$，因此", "$t = (104 \\pm 1)\\,\\unit{\\micro m}$。", "\\emph{2.} $1/104 \\approx 1\\%$.", "\\emph{3.} 直接测量一张纸，得到", "$(0.1 \\pm 0.5)\\,\\unit{mm}$：相对不确定度约为 $500\\%$", "--- 尺子甚至无法证明这张纸存在。将 $500$", "张纸叠放后，测得的长度乘以 $500$，而尺子的", "绝对不确定度保持不变，相对不确定度缩小了", "同样的 $500$ 倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:orders-of-magnitude:9}", "将各长度除以 $\\qty{2e-10}{m}$。细菌：", "$\\qty{2.0e-6}{m}/\\qty{2e-10}{m} = \\num{1.0e4}$ 个原子。头发：", "$\\qty{7.0e-5}{m}/\\qty{2e-10}{m} = \\num{3.5e5}$。人体：", "$1.7/\\num{2e-10} = \\num{8.5e9}$，数量级为 $10^{10}$：从头到脚", "约一百亿个原子。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:orders-of-magnitude:10}", "\\emph{1.} $s = \\qty{0.22}{m}/\\qty{1.39e9}{m} = \\num{1.58e-10}$.", "\\emph{2.} 地球：", "$\\qty{1.27e7}{m} \\times \\num{1.58e-10} = \\qty{2.0e-3}{m} =", "\\qty{2.0}{mm}$ --- 一粒胡椒粒 --- 以距足球", "$\\qty{1.496e11}{m} \\times \\num{1.58e-10} = \\qty{23.7}{m} \\approx", "\\qty{24}{m}$ 的距离绕行。", "\\emph{3.} 月球：", "$\\qty{3.84e8}{m} \\times \\num{1.58e-10} = \\qty{6.1}{cm}$，距", "胡椒粒。海王星：", "$\\qty{4.50e12}{m} \\times \\num{1.58e-10} \\approx \\qty{710}{m}$：模型", "无法放进校园里。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:orders-of-magnitude:11}", "\\emph{1.} $21.0 \\times 29.7 = \\qty{623.7}{cm^2}$，四舍五入至输入数据的三位", "有效数字：$\\qty{624}{cm^2}$。", "\\emph{2.} $v = \\qty{100.0}{m}/\\qty{12.3}{s} = \\qty{8.13}{m/s}$（三位", "有效数字，由时间决定）。", "\\emph{3.} 若取五位有效数字，就等于声称面积精确到", "$\\qty{0.01}{cm^2}$，而毫米级的输入数据从未", "达到过此精度 --- 多写的小数位依然是造假。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}